note: `dose` replaced the variable of that name (line 1)
note: `diet` replaced the variable of that name (line 1)
note: 1 of the model's 4 columns is determined by the others (a combination of levels with no observations, or a term that repeats the others) and carries no degree of freedom (line 2)
note: `dose:diet` has no degrees of freedom once the other terms are in the model, so it has no test (line 2)
error[Z0802]: fewer than two marginal means of `diet` can be estimated, so there is no pair to compare
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:100
  |
2 | d.where(!(dose == "high" && diet == "a") && dose != "mid").anova(gain ~ dose * diet).posthoc(term: diet)
  |                                                                                                    ^^^^ nothing to compare
  |
  = help: with an interaction in the model, a marginal mean needs a row in every combination of its level with the levels of the other category; `tabulate` shows the cells, and the model without the interaction can estimate every mean

